00:47:35,880 --> 00:47:36,200
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Correct.

496
00:47:37,200 --> 00:47:39,600
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Yung po ang aming, kaya po nahirapan din po ang aming auditor na maghanap.

